OL,3,GNEWSACouncil set to axe climate
OL,4,Aemergency declaration
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK-led Barnsley Council has
OL,7,Fannounced its intention to withdraw its
OL,8,Fclimate emergency declaration.
OL,10,FThe party said a review of all climate
OL,11,Fand net-zero activity was under way,
OL,12,Fsaying programmes that lacked a clear
OL,13,Fresident benefit, financial saving or
OL,14,Fstatutory requirement should change or
OL,15,Fstop.
OL,17,FThe council's intention is to withdraw
OL,18,Fthe Climate Emergency declaration from
OL,19,F2019, Zero40, Zero45 and similar
OL,20,Fnet-zero targets, and to direct
OL,21,Fresources to frontline services.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
