OL,3,GNEWSACouncil set to axe climate
OL,4,Aemergency declaration
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader William Brown said: "Our
OL,7,Ffocus is on practical priorities that
OL,8,Fmatter to residents, rather than
OL,9,Fideological targets and costly
OL,10,Fpolitical posturing."
